@startuml US110-SSD
autonumber
actor "ATCC" as ATCC
participant "AISafe System" as System

activate ATCC
ATCC -> System: POST /api/flight-routes (origin, destination, distance, time, requirements)
activate System

alt Airports are valid and OPERATIONAL
    System --> ATCC: 201 Created (Flight Route Details + HATEOAS links)
else Airports do not exist
    System --> ATCC: 404 Not Found
else Airports not OPERATIONAL / Invalid Payload
    System --> ATCC: 400 Bad Request
end

deactivate System
deactivate ATCC
@enduml